/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 75 0 R
/T (In a smart home system, sensors include motion detectors, temperature sensors, door/window sensors, and real-time clocks. Actuators include lighting circuits, thermostats, door locks, alarms, and appliances. The agent program processes sensor input and decides which actuators to activate.)
/E (In a smart home system, sensors include motion detectors, temperature sensors, door/window sensors, and real-time clocks. Actuators include lighting circuits, thermostats, door locks, alarms, and appliances. The agent program processes sensor input and decides which actuators to activate.)
