<<
/Title (A robot is placed in an unknown maze and must find a path to the exit without prior knowledge of the layout. Explain how uninformed search strategies like Uniform Cost Search \(UCS\) and Iterative Deepening Search \(IDS\) can help solve this problem. Discuss the advantages and disadvantages of these algorithms in terms of time and space complexity. Relate the problem to different types of intelligent agents and explain how agent design affects decision-making. Suggest which combination of agent type and search strategy would be most effective and justify your choice.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 600 0 R
>>
endobj
